:"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119347","id":4518844736,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDVgZQA","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-22T12:58:16Z","updated_at":"2026-05-22T12:58:16Z","body":"Tested again. The two issues I mentioned [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119347#pullrequestreview-4262017405) are still present: the checkbox doesn't display the partial state, and selecting an option with a partial state selection results in funky behavior (sometimes it enables the option for all nodes, sometimes it disables, sometimes it toggles individually... idk).\r\n\r\nNow that the full selection is used, adding non-instance nodes to the selection hides the `Make Local` / `Editable Children` / `Load as Placeholder` options. This is a working and simple solution, but I think it's preferable and more user friendly to show those options even when just one of the selected nodes is a PackedScene instance, and to only apply the option to the nodes that it can apply to.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b4616ae1-c1d4-4e82-9e29-39b3fc3ad95f","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4518844736/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4519367767","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119347#issuecomment-4519367767","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119347","id":4519367767,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDWAUVw","user":{"login":"DexterFstone","id":92402263,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYHyVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92402263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone","html_url":"https://github.com/DexterFstone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-22T14:00:38Z","updated_at":"2026-05-22T14:00:38Z","body":"> the checkbox doesn't display the partial state, and selecting an option with a partial state selection results in funky behavior (sometimes it enables the option for all nodes, sometimes it disables, sometimes it toggles individually... idk).\r\n\r\nWell, it's based on majority: if 2 items are active and 1 is inactive, the next state is inactive.\r\nThe checkbox shows the representation; if it's checked, the next state is unchecked, and vice versa.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4519367767/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4519528673","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119347#issuecomment-4519528673","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119347","id":4519528673,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDWKI4Q","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-22T14:20:26Z","updated_at":"2026-05-22T14:20:26Z","body":"> it's based on majority: if 2 items are active and 1 is inactive, the next state is inactive. The checkbox shows the representation; if it's checked, the next state is unchecked, and vice versa.\r\n\r\nThis is highly uncommon UX. The partial state checkbox is precisely the software standard UX language that clarifies that only some of the selected items are checked. Godot already uses it in various places (like in the export template manager). You show the partial state checkbox when not all of the items are checked, and if you click on an option with a partial state checkbox you enable the remaining items so that the checkbox becomes fully checked. clicking after that simple toggles back to disabled, etc.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4519528673/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4520007877","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119347#issuecomment-4520007877","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119347","id":4520007877,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDWnYxQ","user":{"login":"DexterFstone","id":92402263,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYHyVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92402263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone","html_url":"https://github.com/DexterFstone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFsto